title Vinyl Knock-knock on a launcher without the screen request (0.10.3, the HackBerry): no row on the Playback page, and a setting left On does nothing (three quick taps on the cover, then the output button opens its page)
sizes 640x480
ppmm 901
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE playback
env VINYL_DEMO_KNOCK 1

wait 900
shot 01-playback-no-row
expect text "Gapless"
expect notext "Knock-knock"
key left
wait 400
key left
wait 600
shot 02-now
tapxy 0.223 0.373
tapxy 0.223 0.373
tapxy 0.223 0.373
wait 300
tap "Evolve 65"
wait 300
shot 03-output-opens
expect text "Automatic"
expect noquit
